      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young East Asian noblewoman in <Picture 1>, featuring hyper-detailed porcelain skin with visible fine pores, delicate facial features, a red butterfly forehead mark (huadian), an elaborate black hair bun with gold, enamel blue butterfly, and pearl tassel ornaments, wearing blue translucent hanfu robes with a red embroidered under-corset and a heart-shaped gold pearl necklace.\n<Subject 2> is the ancient Chinese pavilion interior in <Picture 1>, featuring soft blurred wooden lattice windows, traditional architecture, and warm diffused sunlight.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A 10-second cinematic ancient Chinese short-drama video. <Subject 1> sits in <Subject 2>, softly brushing her cheek and delivering flirtatious Chinese dialogue with playful, seductive facial expressions in fluid 1.0x real-time speed without slow motion.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the woman's facial features, forehead mark, ornate butterfly headpiece, blue hanfu attire, gold necklace, and porcelain skin texture are fully retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the blurred ancient pavilion environment and soft warm lighting are fully retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is rendered in an ultra-high-definition cinematic ancient short-drama style, capturing intricate costume textures and playful micro-expressions under soft daylight.\n[Shot 1] The video opens in a close-up, fully anchored to <Picture 1>. <Subject 1> sits inside <Subject 2>, resting her right hand near her cheek, her manicured fingertips lightly tracing along her jawline in a slow, lingering gesture. Her long gold pearl tassel earrings sway gently with the movement. From 00:00.000 to 00:03.500, she tilts her head slightly, her lips parting into a subtle, knowing smirk while her eyes glint with playful mischief. At 00:03.500, she leans forward slightly toward the camera lens, her gaze holding an alluring, teasing intensity. <Subject 1> (S1) speaks in a soft, airy, and flirtatious Chinese vocal tone: <d>[Chinese] 嘴上说着不理人，眼神倒是诚实得很呢。</d> As she finishes the line at 00:07.500, her smile deepens, and she gives a playful, subtle wink before lowering her hand slightly to let her sheer blue sleeve drape smoothly over her shoulder through 00:10.000. The camera executes a slow, intimate push-in toward her face throughout the shot.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet ancient pavilion ambience, the soft brush of manicured fingers along delicate skin, subtle rustle of sheer silk sleeves, and a gentle breathing sound.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA playful, sultry ancient Chinese instrumental track led by a slow pipa strum with warm, modern synth pads underscoring the flirtatious mood."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young East Asian noblewoman in <Picture 1>, featuring hyper-detailed porcelain skin with visible fine pores, delicate facial features, a red butterfly forehead mark (huadian), an elaborate black hair bun with gold, enamel blue butterfly, and pearl tassel ornaments, wearing blue translucent hanfu robes with a red embroidered under-corset and a heart-shaped gold pearl necklace.\n<Subject 2> is the ancient Chinese pavilion interior in <Picture 1>, featuring soft blurred wooden lattice windows, traditional architecture, and warm diffused sunlight.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A 10-second cinematic ancient Chinese short-drama video. <Subject 1> sits in <Subject 2>, softly brushing her cheek and delivering flirtatious Chinese dialogue with playful, seductive facial expressions in fluid 1.0x real-time speed without slow motion.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the woman's facial features, forehead mark, ornate butterfly headpiece, blue hanfu attire, gold necklace, and porcelain skin texture are fully retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the blurred ancient pavilion environment and soft warm lighting are fully retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is rendered in an ultra-high-definition cinematic ancient short-drama style, capturing intricate costume textures and playful micro-expressions under soft daylight.\n[Shot 1] The video opens in a close-up, fully anchored to <Picture 1>. <Subject 1> sits inside <Subject 2>, resting her right hand near her cheek, her manicured fingertips lightly tracing along her jawline in a slow, lingering gesture. Her long gold pearl tassel earrings sway gently with the movement. From 00:00.000 to 00:03.500, she tilts her head slightly, her lips parting into a subtle, knowing smirk while her eyes glint with playful mischief. At 00:03.500, she leans forward slightly toward the camera lens, her gaze